   LDX UPTR,B; RCLR DA; RCLR DD; JPL I (SETR
   LDX UPTR,B; RCLR DA; RCLR DD; JPL I (SETW
L4A,  LDX OPTR,B; JPL I (GCI; JMP L5
   LDX UPTR,B; JPL I (WCI; JMP I (LFF; JMP L4A
