L7,   LDA MBUF+1,B; JAZ L6; SAA 1; COPY DD SA
   LDA INDX,B; SAT 12; SAX 3; JPL I (SPACE
   SAT 1; SAA 3; JPL I (OSPF
   JPL I (WHUSR; SUB USERN,B; JAZ L7A
   SAA ##(; JPL I (TCO
   LDX UPTR,B; JPL I (SOUT; SAA ##); JPL I (TCO
L7A,  LDX OPTR,B; SAT MBUF+1; RADD DT SB
   SAA 20; SAD SHR 20; JPL I (SETUP
   LDX OPTR,B; SAA 20; SAD SHR 20; JPL I (SETW
L8,   LDX OPTR,B; JPL I (GCI; JMP L9; JAZ L9
   JPL I (TCO; JMP L8
L9,   LDA MBUF+11,B; JAZ L10A
   LDX OPTR,B; SAT MBUF+11; RADD DT SB
   SAA 4; SAD SHR 20; JPL I (SETUP
   LDX OPTR,B; SAA 4; SAD SHR 20; JPL I (SETW
   SAA ##:; JPL I (TCO
