   JPL I (TCO; JMP L10
L10A, JPL I (CRLF; JMP L6
L11,  STT INDX,B; AAA 1; JAZ XSS; JMP L7
XSS,  MIN LREG,B
LFF,  RET
LF1,  LDX (MS1; JPL I (MSG; JMP XSS
   )FILL
